WEBVTT

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.500
What is blocking this launch, and what should I fix first?

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:24.800
The checklist says trusted downloads are blocked because the app still needs a Developer ID Application certificate and notarization.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:32.200
Fix signing and notarization first, then test the downloaded app on another Mac before public release.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:35.300
The native build and documentation are marked complete.
